message: >-
  If you use this software or its data, please cite it as
  below.
title: >-
  Runtime assurance monitor — prototype and falsification
  campaign
abstract: >-
  Executable prototype of an assurance monitor for an autonomous
  embedded decision layer, with an auditable decision-trace
  artefact, and Monte Carlo campaigns evaluating whether hardening
  on estimation uncertainty provides an additional safety benefit
  in the tested scenario. Negative result: the safety envelope
  alone reaches zero observed violations in the tested campaigns;
  every hardening variant costs availability without preventing
  any additional observed violation.
